description:
We are seeking an experienced SL2 Engineer with strong undestanding in Networking (DNS, CDN, Routing, WAF, Ingress/Egress) to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for:









* Troubleshooting, debugging, and resolving technical issues to maintain optimal performance and reliability.
* Collaborating closely with client teams to ensure project goals are met and delivering robust, scalable solutions.









**Mandatory Skills Description:** 



* Experience in SL2 support (5\+ year);
* Networking \- advanced understanding of modern network topologies (TCP/IP stack) and traffic management: HTTPS, DNS, TCP, IP, routing, load balancing, WAF, 3\+ years;
* Troubleshooting and Root Cause analysis \- experienced with command\-line utilities for troubleshooting: openssl, nslookup/dig, curl, traceroute, etc.;
* Hands\-on experience with any cloud provider (Azure, AWS, GCP): 3\+ years (1\+ years of intensive experience);
* Experience with Golang development;
* Experience with React development;
* Deep understanding of enterprise application architecture patterns;
* Experience working in distributed teams;
* Excellent communication skills for effective collaboration with client teams.
